      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true given that $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix which has only $3$ non-pivot column?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $A$ is  **not** invertible\n- **II.** $\\text{Col}(A)$ is a $4$-dimensional subspace of ${R}^{7}.$\n- **III.** $\\text{nullity}(A)=1$",
